 World: How Different Cultures Name Their Pets</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Explore fascinating animal naming traditions from cultures worldwide. From Japanese temple names to Nordic mythological names, discover how different societies name their beloved pets.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/chinese-animal-names-symbolism-meaning/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🐉</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Cultural Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">Chinese Animal Names: Symbolism, Meaning &amp; 200+ Beautiful Choices</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Discover the beauty of Chinese animal names and their deep cultural symbolism. From dragons to pandas, explore meaningful Chinese names perfect for pets with rich cultural heritage.</p></a><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-5 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group\" href=\"/blog/french-pet-names-elegant-chic-ideas/\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🥐</div><span class=\"text-xs bg-primary/10 text-primary font-semibold px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full\">Cultural Names</span><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-800 mt-2 group-hover:text-primary line-clamp-2\">French Pet Names: 200+ Elegant &amp; Chic Ideas for Your Animal Companion</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1 line-clamp-2\">Explore elegant French pet names that bring Parisian charm to your animal companion. From classic to modern, discover chic French names perfect for dogs, cats, and more.</p></a></div></section><nav class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4\" aria-label=\"Post navigation\"><a class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-4 border border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md hover:border-primary/30 transition-all group text-left\" href=\"